## Why This Is Asked
Addresses real fintech needs: fraud detection in multilingual chats with real-time constraints, privacy considerations, and production-grade monitoring.

## Key Concepts
- Multilingual transformers (XLM-R, mBERT) vs lightweight baselines
- Per-language calibration of thresholds
- Privacy: Federated learning, differential privacy (DP-SGD), on-device inference
- Explainability: attention-based explanations, feature importances
- Drift and fairness monitoring in production

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo
const model = loadModel('xlmr-base');
function classify(text, lang){
  const tokens = tokenize(text, lang);
  return model.predict(tokens);
}
```

